cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the article below."
title: "comp: cfDNA fragmentation profiling at transcription start sites"
abstract: >-
  Code of the analysis in "Genome-wide Cell-free DNA Fragmentation Profiling
  at Transcription Start Sites Detects Cancer Without Cancer-Type-Specific
  Region Selection": feature extraction from FinaleDB records, the nested
  cross-validation of the cancer detection models, and the source data and
  notebooks of every figure.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/DelftBioinformaticsLab/comp"
keywords:
  - cell-free DNA
  - fragmentomics
  - transcription start sites
  - cancer detection
  - liquid biopsy
